{"id":"0df3c545e3defffc","group":"90","path":"90/90-fact-numeral-injective.md","title":"fact-numeral-injective — Numeral Function is Injective","display":"fact-numeral-injective — Numeral Function is Injective","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-fact-numeral-injective","aliases":["90-fact-numeral-injective"],"display":"fact-numeral-injective — Numeral Function is Injective","depends_on":["[[90-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-fact-numeral-injective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-fact-numeral-injective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-numeral-injective — Numeral Function is Injective"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n,\\overline m\">\\(\\overline n,\\overline m\\)</span> (numeral terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}injective}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\overline n=\\overline m\\leftrightarrow n=m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}injective}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\overline n=\\overline m\\leftrightarrow n=m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这里的等号是数码项的语法相等；递归定义的构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S\">\\(0,S\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto\\overline n\">\\(n\\mapsto\\overline n\\)</span> 单射。</li>\n<li>该事实不需要引入理论内可证性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\overline n,\\overline m$ (numeral terms, see [[90-df-numeral]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n,\\overline m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}injective}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\overline n=\\overline m\\leftrightarrow n=m.","display":true},{"tex":"0,S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto\\overline n","display":false}],"bytes":738,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md]]\n[[90-fact-godel-number-effective.md]]\n[[90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-fact-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md]]\n[[90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md]]\n[[90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md]]"}],"outgoing":["d53b945955293235"]}